description	"Clan Ordo Mandalorian

A Mandalorian who followed Mandalore the Preserver, equipped with a Longsword, Cloaking Field and Assault Rifle.

^2Weaponry:
- Heavy Melee
- Longsword
-- Yellow Style Only
-- Saber Defense (1)
- Mandalorian Assault Rifle (1)
-- Based on the EE4
-- 10% More Damage

^8Attributes:
- Cloak (1) ^3[CS3]
- Assemble (2)
- Physical Resist
- 20% less Kb Taken
- 25% slower Skill Cd"
